            {% render "custom-fileupload" %}

            {%- comment -%}
              All products using this section render the four-tab UI
              (Upload / Previous Designs / Create with AI / Design Studio).
              The previous A/B test gate (`template.suffix == 'by-size-tabs'
              or 'by-size-bg-options'`) was removed — the legacy native
              uploadArea + `dtf-create-options-cards` 50/50 tile grid is no
              longer rendered. `dtf-upload-tabs.liquid` renders the
              uploadArea + aiImageGenerator inside its Upload and AI tabs,
              so those `__multipleSnippets` contentFor renders are NOT
              duplicated here.
            {%- endcomment -%}
