              render '__multipleSnippets' product: product, section: section, block: block, contentFor: 'fileuploadOptions'
              endcomment
            -%}
            {%- comment -%}
              Modern Create-with-AI modal. dtf-upload-tabs.liquid renders the
              legacy `.generative-ai-area` pink box inline; dtf-ai-modal.js's
              capture-phase click handler intercepts clicks on that box (and
              on the post-upload "Create with AI" link via
